1
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,940
Hey, Liz. What's wrong?

2
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,040
I've got a cold.

3
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:18,340
So? Everyone gets a cold sometimes. What's the problem?

4
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:26,080
The problem? The problem is, there's the school concert tomorrow. And I'm the singer!

5
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,140
I'm sure you can still sing.

6
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:33,340
No way, Claudio! Listen to my voice!

7
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:40,360
She's right. This really is a problem. Oh, Liz, I'm sorry.

8
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:44,880
Don't worry, Liz. We're here to help you.

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,500
How, Claudio?

10
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,020
I don't know!

11
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:56,448
Just a minute. I've got an idea. Lucy, you can sing, can't you?

12
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:01,500
A little, Liz. But I can't sing with a band.

13
00:01:02,264 --> 00:01:07,860
Oh, come on, Lucy. You can do it. You're a great singer.

14
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:18,560
OK, I'll do it for you, Liz. But this is crazy! OK, what are the songs?

15
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:23,080
I'll tell you later. You're the best, Lucy!

